{{!--
    The GM's script for the scene they are running.

    GM-only by CONSTRUCTION, not by a conditional: foundry/scene-runner.mjs
    is never instantiated on a player's client at all, the same way
    DirectorBar is not (doctrine Law 11 — redaction is removal, not hiding).
    There is therefore no `canDirect` guard anywhere in this file, and adding
    one would be a sign somebody had made the panel reachable by a player.

    The toggle button and the sliding drawer are ONE chassis (this file's
    single root, .bi-runner-frame) for the same reason phone.hbs's button and
    panel are one -- a re-render can never leave them disagreeing about
    open/closed. The button lives OUTSIDE .bi-runner-shell so the shell's own
    slide-offscreen transform never carries it away: a closed drawer must
    still be findable.

    REBUILT 2026-09-24 at Ingram's request: "Reconsider it carefully... it
    needs to be wider to get more contents on screen and so the actual
    'scene' part will have to shrink for the GM again." The old panel was one
    560px column and a nine-thousand-pixel scroll: every beat printed in full,
    the people two screens below the beats in a closed fold. This one is a
    wide drawer (about 43% of the screen, and draggable) laid out as columns:

      header    — where the table is: scene, clock, required beats, the
                  episode's running order, the rooms, Close this scene
      script    — the goal, then the scene in the order it is run: the
                  opening, one line per beat with the beat being run open,
                  the ending, and Close this scene again at the foot
      people    — who is on stage, the clock, what to tempt them with, and a
                  card per cast member (the one the current beat is about
                  opens by itself, so their voice sits beside the line)
      kit       — handouts, things they keep, summon anyone, the rules
      composer  — the note bar, always at the foot

    Below ~760px of drawer the columns stack into one scroll; above ~1320px
    the people and the kit get a column each (container queries on
    .bi-runner, bi-components.css).

    Redesigned 2026-09-19 at Ingram's own direction, reacting to a live
    screenshot: "We're not even locked to the paper look. The goal is
    comprehension and understandability. Rapid access to information.
    First order retrieval." This panel carries its own --sr-* token theme
    (bi-components.css, ".bi-runner" and ".bi-runner[data-bi-theme=dark]"),
    switchable per client via the theme toggle in the tier-1 row, dark by
    default per Ingram's own stated preference the same day.
--}}
<div class="bi-runner-frame">
    <button type="button" class="bi-runner-toggle" data-action="toggle" aria-pressed="{{open}}"
        aria-label="{{localize 'BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Toggle'}}" data-tooltip="{{localize 'BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Toggle'}}">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-clipboard-list bi-runner-toggle__glyph"></i>
    </button>
<section class="bi-runner-shell{{#if open}} bi-runner-shell--open{{/if}}">
<section class="bi-runner" data-bi-theme="{{theme}}">
    <header class="bi-runner__head">
        <div class="bi-runner__head-line">
            <p class="bi-runner__episode">{{#if episodeTitle}}{{episodeTitle}}{{else}}{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Title"}}{{/if}}{{#if position}} <span class="bi-runner__position">{{position}}</span>{{/if}}</p>

            {{!-- TIER 1 -- design/ux-doctrine.md Law 7: "frequency sets
                  distance from the hand... nothing important is more than
                  one tap away." The header never scrolls. Close Scene is the
                  loudest thing in it; the Palette ("Anything else...") is
                  the smallest and quietest, the backup for when nothing else
                  fits. --}}
            <div class="bi-runner__tier1">
                {{#if title}}
                <button type="button" class="bi-runner__tier1-btn bi-runner__tier1-btn--close" data-action="closeScene">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-flag-checkered"></i> {{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.CloseScene"}}
                </button>
                {{/if}}
                <button type="button" class="bi-runner__tier1-btn" data-action="jumpToSummon" data-tooltip="{{localize 'BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.SummonHint'}}">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-masks-theater"></i> {{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Summon.Title"}}
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="bi-runner__tier1-btn" data-action="focusRules" data-tooltip="{{localize 'BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Rules.Placeholder'}}">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-book"></i> {{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Rules.Title"}}
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="bi-runner__theme-toggle" data-action="toggleTheme"
                    title="{{localize 'BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.ThemeToggle'}}"
                    aria-label="{{localize 'BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.ThemeToggle'}}">
                    {{#if themeIsDark}}<i class="fa-solid fa-sun"></i>{{else}}<i class="fa-solid fa-moon"></i>{{/if}}
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="bi-runner__tier1-palette" data-action="openPalette"
                    data-tooltip="{{localize 'BLANKINHERITANCE.Palette.Keybinding'}}"
                    title="{{localize 'BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Palette'}}"
                    aria-label="{{localize 'BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Palette'}}">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-terminal"></i>
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="bi-runner__tier1-palette" data-action="toggle"
                    title="{{localize 'BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Hide'}}"
                    aria-label="{{localize 'BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Hide'}}">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-angles-left"></i>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bi-runner__head-main">
            <h2 class="bi-runner__title">{{#if title}}{{title}}{{else}}{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.PickScene"}}{{/if}}</h2>
            {{#if title}}
            <div class="bi-runner__status">
                {{!-- How long this has been running, against how long it said
                      it would. A statement of fact, not a countdown: a GM
                      twelve minutes over on a scene the table is enjoying is
                      not doing anything wrong. Kept current between renders
                      by #startTimer. --}}
                {{#if pacing.started}}
                <span class="bi-runner__timer{{#if pacing.isOver}} bi-runner__timer--over{{/if}}"
                    data-pace-started="{{pacing.startedAt}}" data-pace-runs="{{runsAbout}}"
                    data-tooltip="{{localize 'BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.TimerHint'}}">
                    <i class="fa-regular fa-clock"></i> <span class="bi-runner__timer-value">{{pacing.label}}</span>
                </span>
                {{else}}
                {{#if runsAbout}}<span class="bi-runner__timer bi-runner__timer--idle" data-tooltip="{{runsAbout}}"><i class="fa-regular fa-clock"></i> {{#if pacing.label}}{{pacing.label}}{{else}}{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.NotStarted"}}{{/if}}</span>{{/if}}
                {{/if}}
                {{#if mode}}<span class="bi-runner__pill">{{mode}}</span>{{/if}}
                {{#if accomplishment}}<span class="bi-runner__pill" data-tooltip="{{accomplishment.forWhat}}">{{accomplishment.xp}} XP</span>{{/if}}
                {{#if clock}}<span class="bi-runner__pill bi-runner__pill--clock{{#if clock.exhausted}} bi-runner__pill--spent{{/if}}">{{clock.name}} {{clock.current}}/{{clock.limit}}</span>{{/if}}
                {{#if requiredSegments.length}}
                <span class="bi-runner__progress" data-tooltip="{{localize 'BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Progress'}}">
                    {{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Required"}}
                    <span class="bi-runner__meter">{{#each requiredSegments}}<span class="bi-runner__meter-seg{{#if done}} bi-runner__meter-seg--done{{/if}}{{#if ruledOut}} bi-runner__meter-seg--out{{/if}}"></span>{{/each}}</span>
                    <b>{{progress.mandatoryDone}}/{{progress.mandatory}}</b>
                </span>
                {{/if}}
            </div>
            {{/if}}
        </div>

        {{!-- The episode's running order -- every scene one press away, which
              both loads its script AND cues its own Scene (2026-09-19: these
              used to be two separate steps, the second one undiscoverable).
              Closed scenes are marked; only this one and the next one print
              their titles, the rest keep theirs in a tooltip, so eleven scenes
              fit one line instead of three. --}}
        {{#if steps.length}}
        <nav class="bi-runner__steps" aria-label="{{localize 'BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.RunningOrder'}}">
            <ol class="bi-runner__scenes">
                {{#each steps}}
                <li><button type="button" class="bi-runner__scene" data-action="cueScene"
                        data-brief-id="{{briefRef}}" aria-current="{{isCurrent}}" data-closed="{{isClosed}}" data-next="{{isNext}}"
                        data-tooltip="{{order}}. {{title}} — {{localize 'BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.CueSceneHint'}}"><span class="bi-runner__scene-order">{{order}}</span>{{#if showTitle}}<span class="bi-runner__scene-title">{{#if isNext}}{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Next"}} {{/if}}{{title}}</span>{{/if}}</button></li>
                {{/each}}
            </ol>

            {{!-- The PICTURES for this brief: the room it opens in and every
                  room inside it, one press each. The running order picks
                  which script to run; this picks what the table looks at. --}}
            {{#if backdrops.length}}
            <ul class="bi-runner__backdrops" aria-label="{{localize 'BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Rooms'}}">
                {{#each backdrops}}
                <li><button type="button"
                        class="bi-runner__backdrop{{#if this.isSub}} bi-runner__backdrop--sub{{/if}}{{#if this.isCurrent}} bi-runner__backdrop--on{{/if}}"
                        data-action="cutTo" data-scene-id="{{this.id}}"
                        data-tooltip="{{localize 'BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.CutTo'}}: {{this.name}}">{{this.label}}</button></li>
                {{/each}}
            </ul>
            {{/if}}
        </nav>
        {{/if}}

        {{!-- The table is looking at a different scene from the script on
              screen -- reading ahead, or a cut from somewhere else. Said out
              loud, with the way back, rather than left for the GM to notice
              when a player asks why the room looks wrong. --}}
        {{#if tableElsewhere}}
        <p class="bi-runner__elsewhere">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation"></i>
            <span>{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.TableElsewhere"}} <b>{{tableElsewhere.sceneName}}</b></span>
            <button type="button" class="bi-runner__stamp" data-action="cutTo" data-scene-id="{{tableElsewhere.targetId}}">{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.CutHere"}}</button>
        </p>
        {{/if}}
    </header>

    <div class="bi-runner__cols">
        {{!-- THE SCRIPT: the scene in the order it is run. --}}
        <div class="bi-runner__script">
            {{#unless title}}
            <div class="bi-runner__empty">
                <p>{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.NoScene"}}</p>
                {{#if steps.length}}
                <ol class="bi-runner__pick">
                    {{#each steps}}
                    <li><button type="button" class="bi-runner__pick-scene" data-action="cueScene" data-brief-id="{{briefRef}}"><span class="bi-runner__scene-order">{{order}}</span> {{title}}</button></li>
                    {{/each}}
                </ol>
                {{/if}}
            </div>
            {{/unless}}

            {{!-- The goal box. First, always, and stating a checkable outcome
                  rather than a theme — "what has to be true when this ends".
                  The summary and how to play it sit under it; `howToPlay`
                  carries the one bold instruction the author marked as the
                  one that breaks the scene if missed. --}}
            {{#if goal}}
            <section class="bi-runner__goalbox">
                <p class="bi-runner__goal-label">{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Goal"}}</p>
                <p class="bi-runner__goal">{{goal}}</p>
                {{#if summary}}<p class="bi-runner__summary">{{summary}}</p>{{/if}}
                {{#if howToPlayHtml}}<p class="bi-runner__howto">{{{howToPlayHtml}}}</p>{{/if}}
            </section>
            {{/if}}

            {{!-- OPENING. design/environmental-storytelling-and-place.md §7:
                  three details by FUNCTION, one landmark to orbit, one held
                  in reserve for when someone leans in. Open by itself until
                  the first beat is marked, then folded to one line — it is
                  read once, at the top, and then it is in the way. --}}
            {{#if intro}}
            <section class="bi-runner__bookend{{#if introOpen}} bi-runner__bookend--open{{/if}}" data-section="intro">
                <div class="bi-runner__bookend-head" data-action="toggleBookend" data-section="intro" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="{{introOpen}}">
                    <span class="bi-runner__bookend-label">{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Intro"}}</span>
                    {{#if intro.where}}<span class="bi-runner__bookend-line">{{intro.where}}</span>{{/if}}
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down bi-runner__chevron"></i>
                </div>
                {{#if introOpen}}
                <div class="bi-runner__bookend-body">
                    {{#if intro.where}}<p class="bi-runner__bookend-lead">{{intro.where}}</p>{{/if}}
                    {{#if intro.firstThing}}<p class="bi-runner__note">{{intro.firstThing}}</p>{{/if}}
                    {{#if intro.decoratedReadAloud}}<div class="bi-runner__read">{{{intro.decoratedReadAloud}}}</div>{{/if}}
                    {{#if intro.landmark}}<p class="bi-runner__landmark"><b>{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Landmark"}}</b> {{intro.landmark}}</p>{{/if}}
                    {{#each intro.carriesIn}}
                    <p class="bi-runner__carries"><b>{{when}}</b> — {{then}}</p>
                    {{/each}}
                    {{#if intro.holdInReserve}}
                    <details class="bi-runner__reserve">
                        <summary>{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.HoldInReserve"}}</summary>
                        <p>{{intro.holdInReserve}}</p>
                    </details>
                    {{/if}}
                </div>
                {{/if}}
            </section>
            {{/if}}

            {{!-- THE RUNNING ORDER. One line per beat; the beat being run is
                  open, with everything needed to run it. Ingram, 2026-09-09:
                  "peekable information which makes it easy to go from a broad
                  overhead to delve into specifics." --}}
            {{#if beats.length}}
            <section class="bi-runner__section bi-runner__order">
                <div class="bi-runner__order-head">
                    <h3 class="bi-runner__section-title">{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Beats"}} <span class="bi-runner__count">{{progress.done}}/{{progress.total}}</span></h3>
                    <button type="button" class="bi-runner__linkbtn" data-action="toggleShowAll" aria-pressed="{{showAll}}">
                        {{#if showAll}}{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.ShowNow"}}{{else}}{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.ShowAll"}}{{/if}}
                    </button>
                </div>
                <ul class="bi-runner__beats">
                    {{#each beats}}
                    {{> "modules/blank-inheritance/templates/runner/beat.hbs"}}
                    {{/each}}
                </ul>
            </section>
            {{/if}}

            {{!-- ENDING. Opens by itself once every required beat is done —
                  the moment it is needed — and stays one line until then. --}}
            {{#if outro}}
            <section class="bi-runner__bookend bi-runner__bookend--ending{{#if outroOpen}} bi-runner__bookend--open{{/if}}" data-section="outro">
                <div class="bi-runner__bookend-head" data-action="toggleBookend" data-section="outro" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="{{outroOpen}}">
                    <span class="bi-runner__bookend-label">{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Outro"}}</span>
                    {{#if outro.endsWhen}}<span class="bi-runner__bookend-line">{{outro.endsWhen}}</span>{{/if}}
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down bi-runner__chevron"></i>
                </div>
                {{#if outroOpen}}
                <div class="bi-runner__bookend-body">
                    {{#if outro.endsWhen}}<p class="bi-runner__bookend-lead">{{outro.endsWhen}}</p>{{/if}}
                    {{#if outro.decoratedReadAloud}}<div class="bi-runner__read">{{{outro.decoratedReadAloud}}}</div>{{/if}}
                    {{#each outro.tracks}}
                    <p class="bi-runner__track"><b>{{track}}</b> {{why}}</p>
                    {{/each}}
                    {{!-- The connective tissue to whatever comes next -- found
                          missing 2026-09-19 (Kit Issue's own outro named the
                          wrong scene AND gave no reason to go there). Shown
                          ahead of the plain `onwards` prose because this is
                          the actionable half: the concrete thing a GM does or
                          says to move the table. --}}
                    {{#if outro.transition}}
                    <p class="bi-runner__transition{{#if outro.transition.scatterRisk}} bi-runner__transition--scatter{{/if}}">
                        <b class="bi-runner__transition-mechanism">{{outro.transition.mechanism}}</b>
                        {{#if outro.transition.line}}{{outro.transition.line}}{{/if}}
                        {{#if outro.transition.scatterRisk}}<span class="bi-runner__transition-warn">{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.TransitionScatterRisk"}}</span>{{/if}}
                    </p>
                    {{/if}}
                    {{#if outro.onwardsHtml}}<p class="bi-runner__note">{{{outro.onwardsHtml}}}</p>{{/if}}
                    {{#if outro.writeDown.length}}
                    <p class="bi-runner__goal-label">{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.WriteDown"}}</p>
                    {{!-- Law 15: recording is a side effect of doing, never a
                          separate task. What's already in the log for THIS
                          scene, shown first -- so writeDown reads as "anything
                          still missing?" rather than "remember everything". --}}
                    {{#if outro.alreadyLogged.length}}
                    <p class="bi-runner__already-logged-label">{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.AlreadyLogged"}}</p>
                    <ul class="bi-runner__jotted">
                        {{#each outro.alreadyLogged}}
                        <li class="bi-runner__jot">{{#if this.tag}}<b class="bi-runner__jot-tag">{{this.tag}}</b> {{/if}}{{this.text}}</li>
                        {{/each}}
                    </ul>
                    {{/if}}
                    {{!-- #178: the equipment locker's own real grant records,
                          not a memory test -- "issue" (what budget bought) and
                          "bonus" (Nobu's free extra) kept apart since Kit
                          Issue's writeDown prompts ask about them separately. --}}
                    {{#if outro.equipmentIssued.length}}
                    <p class="bi-runner__already-logged-label">{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.EquipmentIssued"}}</p>
                    <ul class="bi-runner__jotted">
                        {{#each outro.equipmentIssued}}
                        <li class="bi-runner__jot"><b class="bi-runner__jot-tag">{{this.userName}}</b> {{this.quantity}}&times; {{this.itemName}}</li>
                        {{/each}}
                    </ul>
                    {{/if}}
                    {{#if outro.equipmentBonus.length}}
                    <p class="bi-runner__already-logged-label">{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.EquipmentBonus"}}</p>
                    <ul class="bi-runner__jotted">
                        {{#each outro.equipmentBonus}}
                        <li class="bi-runner__jot"><b class="bi-runner__jot-tag">{{this.userName}}</b> {{this.quantity}}&times; {{this.itemName}}</li>
                        {{/each}}
                    </ul>
                    {{/if}}
                    <ul class="bi-runner__topics">
                        {{#each outro.writeDown}}
                        <li class="bi-runner__topic">{{this}}</li>
                        {{/each}}
                    </ul>
                    {{/if}}
                    {{#if carryForward.length}}
                    <p class="bi-runner__goal-label">{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.CarryForward"}}</p>
                    <ul class="bi-runner__topics">
                        {{#each carryForward}}
                        <li class="bi-runner__topic">{{this}}</li>
                        {{/each}}
                    </ul>
                    {{/if}}
                </div>
                {{/if}}
            </section>
            {{/if}}

            {{!-- The foot-of-the-script Close Scene button. Ingram, 2026-09-22:
                  "we need a 'Close Scene' button at the bottom of each scene
                  in the scene runner, like we have at the top, so that when
                  you scroll all the way to the bottom there is a button
                  waiting there for me to press to move things along."

                  Deliberately the SAME data-action as the header's, so it is
                  the identical handler and the two can never drift apart. The
                  only difference is what reaching it means: you have read to
                  the end of the scene. Guarded by {{#if title}} for the same
                  reason the header's is -- with no scene loaded there is
                  nothing to close. The last thing in the script column. --}}
            {{#if title}}
            <div class="bi-runner__footer-close">
                <button type="button" class="bi-runner__tier1-btn bi-runner__tier1-btn--close bi-runner__footer-close-btn" data-action="closeScene">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-flag-checkered"></i> {{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.CloseScene"}}
                </button>
                <p class="bi-runner__footer-close-hint">{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.CloseSceneFooterHint"}}</p>
            </div>
            {{/if}}
        </div>

        <aside class="bi-runner__side">
            {{!-- PEOPLE: who is here, and what keeps the table moving. --}}
            <div class="bi-runner__people">
                {{!-- Who the table can see right now, whoever put them there,
                      each with a way to take them off again. --}}
                <section class="bi-runner__onstage">
                    <h3 class="bi-runner__section-title">{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.OnStageNow"}}</h3>
                    <div class="bi-runner__onstage-row">
                        {{#each onStageNow}}
                        <span class="bi-runner__onstage-chip{{#if isPc}} bi-runner__onstage-chip--pc{{/if}}">{{label}}<button type="button" class="bi-runner__onstage-off" data-action="unstagePerson" data-portrait-id="{{portraitId}}" aria-label="{{localize 'BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.TakeOff'}}" data-tooltip="{{localize 'BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.TakeOff'}}">&times;</button></span>
                        {{else}}
                        <span class="bi-runner__onstage-none">{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.NobodyOnStage"}}</span>
                        {{/each}}
                        <button type="button" class="bi-runner__linkbtn" data-action="jumpToSummon">+ {{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Summon.Title"}}</button>
                    </div>
                </section>

                {{#if clock}}
                <section class="bi-runner__section bi-runner__clockbox">
                    <h3 class="bi-runner__section-title">{{clock.name}}</h3>
                    {{!-- The GM's own hand on the dial, one step either way. --}}
                    <p class="bi-runner__clock{{#if clock.exhausted}} bi-runner__clock--spent{{/if}}">
                        <button type="button" class="bi-runner__clock-nudge" data-action="nudgeClock" data-delta="-1"
                            aria-label="{{localize 'BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.ClockDown'}}" data-tooltip="{{localize 'BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.ClockDown'}}"{{#unless clock.canLower}} disabled{{/unless}}>&minus;</button>
                        <span class="bi-runner__clock-value">{{clock.current}}</span>
                        <span class="bi-runner__clock-of">{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Of"}} {{clock.limit}}</span>
                        <button type="button" class="bi-runner__clock-nudge" data-action="nudgeClock" data-delta="1"
                            aria-label="{{localize 'BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.ClockUp'}}" data-tooltip="{{localize 'BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.ClockUp'}}"{{#unless clock.canRaise}} disabled{{/unless}}>+</button>
                    </p>
                    {{!-- What the table is living under now, and what comes
                          next -- Law 19: nothing lands without its cost having
                          been visible first. --}}
                    {{#if clock.latest}}
                    <p class="bi-runner__threshold"><b>{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.ClockNow"}}</b> {{clock.latest.effect}}</p>
                    {{/if}}
                    {{#if clock.next}}
                    <p class="bi-runner__threshold bi-runner__threshold--next"><b>{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.ClockNext"}} {{clock.next.atValue}}:</b> {{clock.next.effect}}</p>
                    {{/if}}
                    {{#if spends.length}}
                    <div class="bi-runner__spends">
                        {{#each spends}}
                        <button type="button" class="bi-runner__stamp" data-action="spend" data-spend-id="{{id}}"
                            title="{{note}}">{{label}}</button>
                        {{/each}}
                    </div>
                    {{/if}}
                </section>
                {{/if}}

                {{!-- design/scene-triggers-and-depth.md §3: one sentence the
                      GM can say out loud, unprompted, whenever the table
                      stalls. Always visible, never folded -- see the CSS
                      comment for why. --}}
                {{#if temptations.length}}
                <section class="bi-runner__section bi-runner__temptations">
                    <h3 class="bi-runner__section-title">{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Temptations"}}</h3>
                    <ul class="bi-runner__temptation-list">
                        {{#each temptations}}
                        <li class="bi-runner__temptation">
                            <span class="bi-runner__temptation-text">{{text}}</span>
                            <button type="button" class="bi-runner__temptation-use" data-action="useTemptation"
                                data-temptation-id="{{id}}" title="{{localize 'BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.TemptationUsedHint'}}">{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.TemptationUsed"}}</button>
                        </li>
                        {{/each}}
                    </ul>
                </section>
                {{/if}}

                {{#if cast.length}}
                <section class="bi-runner__section bi-runner__castlist">
                    <h3 class="bi-runner__section-title">{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Cast"}} <span class="bi-runner__count">{{cast.length}}</span></h3>
                    {{#each cast}}
                    {{> "modules/blank-inheritance/templates/runner/person.hbs"}}
                    {{/each}}
                </section>
                {{/if}}
            </div>

            {{!-- KIT: what can be handed over, anyone else, and the rules. --}}
            <div class="bi-runner__kit">
                {{#if handouts.length}}
                <section class="bi-runner__section">
                    <h3 class="bi-runner__section-title">{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Handouts"}} <span class="bi-runner__count">{{handouts.length}}</span></h3>
                    {{#each handouts}}
                    <article class="bi-runner__prop">
                        <h4 class="bi-runner__prop-name">{{title}}</h4>
                        {{#if gmNotes}}<p class="bi-runner__note">{{gmNotes}}</p>{{/if}}
                        {{#if catchables.length}}
                        <ul class="bi-runner__topics">
                            {{#each catchables}}
                            <li class="bi-runner__topic">{{this}}</li>
                            {{/each}}
                        </ul>
                        {{/if}}
                        <div class="bi-runner__actions">
                            <button type="button" class="bi-runner__stamp" data-action="revealHandout"
                                data-handout-id="{{id}}">{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Reveal"}}</button>
                            <button type="button" class="bi-runner__stamp" data-action="revealHandoutSolo"
                                data-handout-id="{{id}}">{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.RevealSolo"}}</button>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                    {{/each}}
                </section>
                {{/if}}

                {{#if artefacts.length}}
                <section class="bi-runner__section">
                    <h3 class="bi-runner__section-title">{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Artefacts"}} <span class="bi-runner__count">{{artefacts.length}}</span></h3>
                    {{#each artefacts}}
                    <article class="bi-runner__prop">
                        <h4 class="bi-runner__prop-name">{{title}}</h4>
                        {{#if earnedBy}}<p class="bi-runner__person-role">{{earnedBy}}</p>{{/if}}
                        {{#if gmNote}}<p class="bi-runner__note">{{gmNote}}</p>{{/if}}
                        <div class="bi-runner__actions">
                            {{#if granted}}
                            <span class="bi-runner__held">{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Held"}}</span>
                            {{else}}
                            <button type="button" class="bi-runner__stamp" data-action="grantArtefact"
                                data-artefact-id="{{id}}">{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Grant"}}</button>
                            {{/if}}
                        </div>
                    </article>
                    {{/each}}
                </section>
                {{/if}}

                {{!-- Summon anyone, onto whatever scene the table is looking
                      at -- a general GM action independent of the loaded
                      brief, so it works with no brief open at all. Folded in
                      2026-09-18 from what used to be its own floating panel. --}}
                <details class="bi-runner__section bi-runner__section--fold" data-section="summon"{{#if sections.summon}} open{{/if}}>
                    <summary class="bi-runner__section-title">{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Summon.Title"}}</summary>
                    {{#if summon.hasScene}}
                    <p class="bi-summon__scene">{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Summon.OntoScene"}} <b>{{summon.sceneName}}</b></p>
                    {{else}}
                    <p class="bi-summon__scene bi-summon__scene--none">{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Summon.NoScene"}}</p>
                    {{/if}}
                    {{#if summon.party.length}}
                    <h4 class="bi-summon__group-title">{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Summon.Party"}}</h4>
                    <ul class="bi-summon__list">
                        {{#each summon.party}}{{> "modules/blank-inheritance/templates/runner/summon-row.hbs"}}{{/each}}
                    </ul>
                    {{/if}}
                    {{#if summon.others.length}}
                    <h4 class="bi-summon__group-title">{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Summon.Others"}}</h4>
                    <ul class="bi-summon__list">
                        {{#each summon.others}}{{> "modules/blank-inheritance/templates/runner/summon-row.hbs"}}{{/each}}
                    </ul>
                    {{/if}}
                </details>

                {{!-- design/ux-doctrine.md §10.7's Rules drawer: a search box
                      over the locally mirrored SRD, answering "the rulebook's
                      own first-listed GM priority... answering questions
                      quickly and decisively." Always open now -- a search box
                      that has to be unfolded before it can be typed in is a
                      box nobody uses mid-scene. --}}
                <section class="bi-runner__section bi-runner__rules" data-section="rules">
                    <h3 class="bi-runner__section-title">{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Rules.Title"}}</h3>
                    <input type="text" class="bi-runner__rules-input" autocomplete="off" value="{{rules.query}}"
                        placeholder="{{localize 'BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Rules.Placeholder'}}"
                        aria-label="{{localize 'BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Rules.Placeholder'}}">
                    {{#if rules.results.length}}
                    <ul class="bi-rules__results">
                        {{#each rules.results}}
                        <li class="bi-rules__result">
                            <p class="bi-rules__result-title">{{this.title}}</p>
                            <p class="bi-rules__result-excerpt">{{this.excerpt}}</p>
                            {{#if this.pageCitation}}<p class="bi-rules__result-citation">{{this.pageCitation}}</p>{{/if}}
                        </li>
                        {{/each}}
                    </ul>
                    {{else}}
                    {{#if rules.query}}<p class="bi-legend">{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.Rules.NoResults"}}</p>{{/if}}
                    {{/if}}
                </section>
            </div>
        </aside>
    </div>

    {{!-- The note bar. Doctrine §10.3: capture during a scene has to cost
          nothing, so this is one field, always at the foot, Enter to save,
          and it says up front which beat the line will attach itself to.
          The tag keys are the log's own accelerators (core/log-entry.mjs),
          offered rather than remembered -- never required. --}}
    {{#if title}}
    <footer class="bi-runner__notebar">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-pen bi-runner__note-glyph" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <input type="text" class="bi-runner__note-input" autocomplete="off"
               placeholder="{{localize 'BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.NotePlaceholder'}}"
               aria-label="{{localize 'BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.NotePlaceholder'}}">
        <span class="bi-runner__note-target">
            {{#if noteTarget}}→ {{noteTarget.text}}{{else}}{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.NoteScene"}}{{/if}}
        </span>
        <span class="bi-runner__note-tags">
            <button type="button" class="bi-runner__note-tag" data-action="noteTag" data-tag="decision">decision</button>
            <button type="button" class="bi-runner__note-tag" data-action="noteTag" data-tag="reaction">reaction</button>
            <button type="button" class="bi-runner__note-tag" data-action="noteTag" data-tag="thread">thread</button>
            <button type="button" class="bi-runner__note-tag" data-action="noteTag" data-tag="npc">npc</button>
        </span>
    </footer>
    {{/if}}

    {{!-- Drag to make the drawer wider or narrower; double-click to go back
          to the default. --}}
    <div class="bi-runner__grip" title="{{localize 'BLANKINHERITANCE.Runner.ResizeHint'}}" aria-hidden="true"></div>
</section>
</section>
</div>
